close_reason: "Final review hardening implemented and focused tests passed; proceed to regenerated changelog, full release validation, exact-head review, and merge."
plan_mode: completed
plan_scope: "Read-only API batch manifests, dry-run preflight, request and response budgets, tool/output schemas, help, documentation, meaningful tests, private live acceptance, release validation, and PR review closeout."
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: Official stable and live Jellyfin 10.11.11 contracts are current. Existing jf api handles one exact operation per process. Implement bounded read-only batch manifests with full preflight and deterministic output; use only owner-only config and JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 for live tests.
plan_validation[2]{text,command,expected}:
  Compiled CLI must execute a synthetic multi-operation read manifest against the configured server in enforced read-only mode.,JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 jf-cli api batch --file <owner-only-manifest> --format json,All synthetic requests preflight and complete in input order; no mutating method is accepted and no private payload is retained.
  Final source-workspace release gate passed on the implementation state.,"bun run validate:release",All release checks complete without lowering thresholds or publishing.
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-25T22:29:53.351Z",codex-jellyfin-batch,Add read-only batch execution below the typed command interface and beside exact single-operation execution.,Agents need one schema resolution and one authenticated process for related reads. Full preflight plus method enforcement prevents partial execution caused by invalid manifests and excludes mutations by construction.,"Current jf api exposes inspect, get, and mutate for one operation per invocation; no PM item or command implements bounded multi-operation manifests."
plan_discoveries[4]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T22:29:52.375Z",codex-jellyfin-batch,Official Jellyfin v10.11.11 remains the latest stable release. The official core artifact contains 388 operations; the configured 10.11.11 server exposes 429 operations across 356 paths because live documents include installed plugin contracts.
  "2026-07-25T22:48:52.041Z",codex-jellyfin-batch,"Portable Vitest initially exposed that the Node Bun.spawn adapter ignored Blob stdin, so batch stdin tests could pass under Bun while failing in the cross-runtime gate. The adapter now pipes Blob bytes into child stdin and focused portable tests pass."
  "2026-07-25T22:48:53.669Z",codex-jellyfin-batch,"Coverage contention exposed an existing compatibility path that validated an unsafe target artifact only after fetching the live baseline. Target identifiers are now rejected before any schema probe, matching the existing security test's stated contract."
  "2026-07-25T23:03:05.543Z",codex-jellyfin-batch,Release preparation found project-managed pm-changelog 2026.7.24 while npm latest is 2026.7.25; pm upgrade refreshed the managed extension to 2026.7.25 without changing CLI release contents.
